{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/86393/31/23326/221722/62443245E7fd61496/719caa7a5a041046.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">服务冬季国际体育赛事</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流在现场</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">专业物流 全方位赛事服务</span></span></em></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">作为&ldquo;相约北京&rdquo;赛事物流服务商，京东物流全力保障冬季国际体育赛事物流服务，为多个仓储中心、竞赛及非竞赛场地提供一体化供应链物流服务，为赛事高效和安全的组织提供可靠的保障。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/220321/22/16337/214777/624432b2Ed90bec75/94d03a87773bf9ed.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/188088/33/21675/164545/624432c2Eeb8f3528/8daccca578d9b523.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/195328/36/22069/165349/624432d7Eaaf580e7/f925b9ac83823787.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/196915/17/21197/113468/624432eaE24192b2a/4cc4720800b0a3ed.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">科技物流 智能化赛事服务</span></strong></span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流不仅在多个场馆投用十几台室内、室外智能快递车和二十多套双面智能配送柜，解决&ldquo;最后一公里&rdquo;无接触配送问题；还引入智能仓储管理设施，并为赛事量身定制MDS系统（总体配送计划）服务，实现物资智能化管理和车辆智能调度。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/193148/28/22583/119648/62443312E18bcade8/9c405605b8b4ade0.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/107080/33/26131/96753/6244331dE779417cc/42409752b3649393.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/123328/18/26352/629830/62443329Ef3fcd0e6/e77fdda1a600fe45.png\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/172018/20/28050/98603/6244333bE9f315766/c4c6a07a64601086.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/217894/40/16102/207921/62443345E32a8da80/8ed7fbd3857fbccb.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">绿色物流 可持续赛事服务</span></strong></span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流利用青流箱实现绿色包装，在主物流中心和场馆内设立物资回收角，提升物流包装再利用率；并在赛区城市配送、场馆内部物流服务100%使用电动物流车，并在张家口赛区试运行氢能源物流车，实现绿色运输。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/113929/26/24174/68431/62443366Ead9199e5/bcdd8b646262ca81.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/92111/39/26656/120732/6244336fEf9f61fbf/41125ce3ce18ab6f.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/123845/1/25602/113292/6244337bEbe59ef9c/628c82dfe80abeee.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东小哥 高质量赛事服务</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流投入了充足的人力、运力，许多一线物流人员一直兢兢业业、坚守岗位，获得了尊重和认可，用饱满的热情为冰雪运动增添了一抹暖色。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/181629/19/21759/636051/62443390E45acba9f/c0d1e4dbdea60c9a.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/88229/8/25186/104837/624433a1E307b3aea/a74e3b2af93fe980.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/102708/9/27083/112379/624433afE693eef12/a8c04e1ead217b8c.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/145247/14/26514/97105/624433bfEec4bf7e1/8c0f6ae2566329e1.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #ba372a;\">致敬服务在一线的伙伴们</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; color: #ba372a;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/108420/14/36396/43354/63f6c8cdF6d3ce108/93ef06b4d70c287d.png\" /></span></strong></a></p>", "conten